  "contentHtml": "<p><span>If you’ve read the finalists of this year’s non-book review contest, </span><strong><a href=\"https://forms.gle/cRxv2HLs1sgEmcJA8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vote for your favorite here</a></strong><span>. Voting will close end of day on Friday, November 20. This year is approval voting; check the box for all reviews you like.</span></p>\n<p>In case you need a refresher, here are the finalists, in order of appearance:</p>\n<p><strong>1: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-book-of-abraham\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Book of Abraham</a><br><strong>2: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-great-and-desperate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Great and Desperate Cures</a><br><strong>3: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/breakdown-in-pakistan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Breakdown in Pakistan</a><br><strong>4: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-epic-of-gilgamesh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Epic of Gilgamesh</a><br><strong>5: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-escape-artist\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Escape Artist</a><br><strong>6: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-a-residence-of-21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">A Residence of 21 Years in the Sandwich Islands</a><br><strong>7: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-thomas-urquharts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thomas Urquhart’s Translation of Rabelais</a><br><strong>8: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-tale-of-genji\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Tale of Genji</a><br><strong>9:</strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-this-is-going-to\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">This is Going to Hurt</a><br><strong>10: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-lee-kuan-yews-memoirs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Lee Kuan Yew’s Memoirs</a><br><strong>11: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-we-present-television\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">We Present Television</a><br><strong>12: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-storm-of-steel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Storm of Steel</a><br><strong>13: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-ghost-in-my\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The Ghost in My Brain</a><br><strong>14: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-the-history-and\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The History and Adventures of an Atom</a><br><strong>15: </strong><a href=\"https://www.astralcodexten.com/p/your-book-review-orality-and-literacy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Orality and Literacy</a></p>\n<p><span>Prediction market is </span><a href=\"https://manifold.markets/CalibratedGhosts/who-will-win-the-scott-alexander-20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a><span>, but don’t peek until after you’ve voted.</span></p>",
